{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_4nvlcyhsipgs3i5sinmqwrmgrdwfst4xk4rq75vqp4tbdu3lko3q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01GXHKuq61H7rbRyUagyVVvx","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"Sj1zQCA7vlG3EkhCBDD7ZI","description":"Read all text on Start Here and Foundations pages","code":"const out=[];\nfor (const id of ['0:1','1:2']) {\n const p = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);\n await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(p);\n out.push('=== '+p.name);\n const walk=(n,d)=>{ let s='  '.repeat(d)+n.type+' '+n.name+' ['+n.id+'] '+Math.round(n.x||0)+','+Math.round(n.y||0)+' '+Math.round(n.width||0)+'x'+Math.round(n.height||0);\n  if(n.type==='TEXT') s+=' :: '+n.characters;\n  if((n.type==='RECTANGLE'||n.type==='FRAME') && n.fills && n.fills.length && n.fills[0].type==='SOLID'){const c=n.fills[0].color; s+=' fill#'+[c.r,c.g,c.b].map(v=>Math.round(v*255).toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('');}\n  out.push(s); if(n.children && d<8) n.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,d+1));};\n p.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,0));\n}\nreturn out.join('\\n');"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":974,"cache_read_input_tokens":7926,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":974,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d897fe38-9444-4efe-87af-bf197997e795","uuid":"2233b4e0-2de0-45e2-933a-c5b36a80b9f8","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:31:43.026Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01GXHKuq61H7rbRyUagyVVvx","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01GXHKuq61H7rbRyUagyVVvx","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 00 · Start Here 设计任务\nFRAME Start Here · Brief [3:39] 0,0 1440x3690 fill#ffffff\n  FRAME Header [3:40] 64,64 1312x176\n    TEXT LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2 [3:41] 0,0 182x20 :: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n    TEXT Investment Wallet — crypto wallet for beginners [3:42] 0,32 1312x54 :: Investment Wallet — crypto wallet for beginners\n    TEXT Design the Investment Wallet mobile app for a beginner investor: see the wallet balance, assets and savings pockets, discover investing strategies and coins, read about the “Aggressive Growth” strategy, invest 3,021 DAI in it and confirm the result. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference. [3:43] 0,98 1312x78 :: Design the Investment Wallet mobile app for a beginner investor: see the wallet balance, assets and savings pockets, discover investing strategies and coins, read about the “Aggressive Growth” strategy, invest 3,021 DAI in it and confirm the result.\nCanvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  FRAME How to work [3:44] 64,288 1312x259\n    TEXT How to work [3:45] 0,0 147x36 :: How to work\n    TEXT 1. Build exactly the 5 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, gain / loss, risk levels, success / disabled, accents and chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply 