{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_jgqhclf4mifa3dglczzxjfvprvwdipp7ezv56sz5dbamzyje3j4a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built all 5 screens, the component library and the prototype in **03 · Workspace**. I took screenshots of all 5 screens and the component board, and fixed what looked wrong. The prototype links are saved in the file, but I haven't clicked through them in Figma's Present mode.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/Sj1zQCA7vlG3EkhCBDD7ZI/\n**Account:** zuohaosheng@tetras.ai (checked before any edits)\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `4:2`\n\nThe reference pages (00, 01, 02 and 04) were only read and are unchanged.\n\n### Screens\n| Frame | ID | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| 01_Wallet | `13:55` | 375 × 1056 (scrolls) |\n| 02_Discovery | `16:143` | 375 × 1747 (scrolls) |\n| 03_Strategy | `19:317` | 375 × 1502 (scrolls, sheet over 02) |\n| 04_Invest_Amount | `21:580` | 375 × 812 (sheet over 02) |\n| 05_Invest_Success | `22:794` | 375 × 812 (sheet over 02) |\n\nEvery item on each screen's \"Must include\" list is there, and all copy and numbers match \"Fixed data\". Text uses Nunito and the brand color is #2B2D33. The coin logos, avatar and icons are instances from 04 · Media. The default Button, Text Field, status bar and home indicator are instances from 02 · Components.\n\nScreens 03–05 show a dimmed copy of the Discovery screen behind the sheet. On the scrolling screens, the page indicator, home indicator and Invest button are pinned to the bottom of the screen while scrolling.\n\n### Design system\n- **Colors:** a \"Wallet Tokens\" variable collection covers text, surfaces, gain/loss, low/medium/high risk, disabled, accents and chart colors. It also holds spacing and corner-radius values.\n- **Styles:** 11 Nunito text styles and 2 shadow styles (card and sheet).\n\n### Components\nAll on the board `7:2` to the right of the screens:\n- **Indicators:** gain/loss badges, page indicator (one version per page), risk badge (Low, Medium, High).\n- **Buttons and controls:** icon button, Send/Receive buttons, primary button with Default/Pressed/Disabled (wraps the given Button), Hold to Invest button (Default/Holding), tab chip (Selected/Default), small pill button.\n- **Headers:** top bar, section header, sheet header (close or back).\n- **Wallet and Discovery:** asset row, pocket card, Add Pocket, For You card, strategy card, coin row.\n- **Strategy and invest:** fact row, share row, share bar, growth chart, keypad key, backspace key, coin chip, info pill, confetti.\n\n### States shown\n- The page indicator shows page 2 on 01 and page 3 on 02.\n- 🔥 Trending is the selected tab.\n- Gains are green and losses red.\n- Each risk level has its own color.\n- On 04, \"3,021\" has a typing cursor and the \"1\" key shows as pressed.\n\n### Prototype links\nThe flow starts at 01_Wallet.\n- **01 → 02:** swipe left or tap the page indicator.\n- **02 → 01:** swipe right or tap the page indicator.\n- **02 → 03:** tap the Aggressive Growth card.\n- **03:** Invest goes to 04; the close button goes back to 02.\n- **04:** back goes to 03; Hold to Invest goes to 05.\n- **05:** close goes to 02; View Pocket goes to 01.\n- **Pressed states:** buttons, keypad keys, strategy cards, icon buttons, Add Pocket and Max switch to their pressed look while held.\n\n### Limitations\n- **Hold to Invest:** Figma has no true \"hold\" trigger. I used \"mouse down\" with a 0.8 s delay. The Holding look exists as a component version but isn't triggered by the hold in the prototype.\n- **Entry-only items:** per the brief, Send, Receive, scan, search, other strategies, coins, other tabs, Max and swap have no destination screens.\n- **Device setting:** I couldn't set the prototype's device frame through the API. Choose iPhone in Figma's prototype settings if it doesn't default to it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2736,"cache_read_input_tokens":121286,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2736,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d897fe38-9444-4efe-87af-bf197997e795","uuid":"490b5b5b-ac86-4366-a083-f0091b341366","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:02:47.167Z"}
